[{"title":"谒陆宣公祠","author":"林景熙","text":"冰玉为骨秋为神，堂堂内相真天人。\n谏草数百垂清芬，仁义一洗功利尘。\n刳肝沥血空排云，白日不鉴吾忠勤。\n奉天诏下哀痛新，将士感泣天亦闻。\n皇威雷动清九垠，一纸可敌百万军。\n草茅学古期致君，以额扣阍九虎嗔。\n玉堂云雾当华津，耿耿何不批龙鳞。\n一尊酹古凄夕曛，鹓湖之水春复春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29461,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"端午次韵怀古或疑屈原曹娥死非正命是不知杀身成仁者也并为发之","author":"林景熙","text":"葵榴入眼明，得酒慰衰齿。\n胡为浪自悲，怀古泪纷委。\n湘江沈忠臣，越江沈孝子。\n沈骨不沈名，清风两江水。\n或云非正命，是昧舍生理。\n归全岂发肤，所惧本心毁。\n哭父天为惊，忧君国将燬。\n于焉偷吾生，何以立戴履。\n脩短在百年，芳秽垂千纪。\n之人死犹生，滔滔真死矣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29462,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蔡琰归汉图","author":"林景熙","text":"文姬别胡地，一骑轻南驰。\n伤哉贤王北，一骑挟二儿。\n二儿抱父啼，问母何所之。\n停鞭屡回首，重会知无期。\n孰云天壤内，野心无人彝。\n凡物以类偶，湿化犹相随。\n穹庐况万里，日暮惊沙吹。\n惜哉辨琴智，不辨华与夷。\n纵怜形势迫，难掩节义亏。\n独有思汉心，写入哀弦知。\n一朝天使至，千金赎蛾眉。\n雨露洗腥瘢，阳和变愁姿。\n出关拜汉月，照妾心苦悲。\n妾心倘未白，何以觐彤墀。\n狐死尚首丘，越鸟终南枝。\n如何李都尉，没齿阴山陲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29463,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题水云深处","author":"林景熙","text":"霏霏弄閒态，滟滟扬素纹。\n幽人不可即，但见水与云。\n苍狗纷世情，瞿塘在平地。\n所以盟白鸥，万荷最深处。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29464,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠兰坡星翁","author":"林景熙","text":"深林澹孤芳，一洗桃李姿。\n采采坡云暮，持之欲遗谁。\n故人青云端，或在江海涯。\n青云达者路，江海幽人期。\n有如一种兰，升沈亦殊岐。\n南宫香满握，谁使纫湘累。\n客笑试问君，君曰数所为。\n嗟予偶阅理，焚膏自童时。\n功名千载芬，白首心已违。\n富贵倘贻臭，不如贫贱怡。\n吾生吾自断，为谢君平帷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29465,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠玉泉真士","author":"林景熙","text":"紫霞之佩绿玉筇，鞭笞鸾凤八极空。\n碧泓照人悬万瞳，黄冠无数趋下风。\n自言试邑沧海东，飘忽风雨倾槐宫。\n湛卢夜吼将安从，尔来长啸招葛洪。\n丹气不死横为虹，全胎十月还倥侗。\n三花自聚天无功，笑我双鬓垂秋蓬。\n十年白石煮不红，安得四方上下如云龙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29466,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠泰霞真士祈雨之验","author":"林景熙","text":"火旂燄燄烧坤垠，蒺藜满道风扬尘。\n槁苗无花不作谷，老农扶杖田头哭。\n哭声不为填沟渠，室罄何以供官输。\n檄龙呗佛寂不应，蜥蜴那能擅权柄。\n泰霞真士鞭风霆，绿章叩天天亦惊。\n玄云沛雨起肤寸，点点都是盘中饭。\n须臾收敛归无声，翩然驾虬出山城。\n我闻调元功自古，亢为常旸伏常雨。\n庙堂有道司牧良，坐看玉烛开金穰。\n淮南捕蝗蝗更在，饥蛟齧人陆成海。\n肥羊日日供大官，论功乃使专黄冠。\n真士寸田无水旱，天机子夜交离坎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29467,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六言 其一","author":"林景熙","text":"沙鸥对立机外，胡蝶相逢梦中。\n帆去帆来野水，花开花落春风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29468,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"林景熙","text":"君不记，犬之年，羊之月，辟历一声天地裂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29469,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"汴河","author":"林曾","text":"一千八百隋家路，两岸青青入帝都。\n可惜翠华南渡后，旧时杨柳一株无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29470,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"溪上谣","author":"林曾","text":"溪翁儿女枕溪住，时把钓竿倚芳树。\n沉吟独坐忍伤心，钓得鱼来放将去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29471,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"林曾","text":"鱼头红结魫，土面白生硝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29472,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿横山祷雨","author":"林棐","text":"寸心忧国愿年丰，晓挈枫香入翠峰。\n幸有一坛瞻斗象，岂无尺水起渊龙。\n松风不住雨声碎，岚雾常随云气浓。\n愿觅天瓢一滴水，三符需梦慰三农。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29473,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泛剡","author":"许棐","text":"水阔无风似有风，芦花摇落橹声中。\n鸥无一点惊猜意，认作当时载雪翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29474,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送交代秘丞归阙","author":"林渭夫","text":"分携何必恨依依，三载无私得意归。\n烟雨乍随孤棹去，鸳鸿重入九霄飞。\n旧题诗句刻文石，新创儒宫在翠微。\n后夜月明回首处，汀风萧飒动行衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29475,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题太岳院壁","author":"林焞","text":"我来劝农值春雨，傍人笑我身蓝缕。\n我身蓝缕分当然，唯有担夫愁艰阻。\n汝担夫，听我语，桑麻谷粟生于土。\n若非雨泽滋发生，粒食片衣谁付与。\n岂不见田间耕耨人，泥涂深没股。\n晓露湿云鬟，歌笑采桑女。\n他时蚕麦倍丰成，罗列瓮盎鸣机杼。\n一旦雨泞不为劳，当念耕农蚕妇终岁服勤苦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29476,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长门曲","author":"林鲁","text":"因宿秋山懒画眉，入宫岁早宠恩迟。\n诗成莫写沟中叶，流到人间是几时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29477,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西峰院","author":"林嗣复","text":"参遍曹溪众所钦，玄堂虚寂砌虫吟。\n定回瞑目谁相顾，好鸟衔花下翠林。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29478,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伏波将军庙","author":"林槩","text":"尉佗尺檄黄关闭，天欲亡秦盛汉家。\n一目将军通战棹，何曾五岭限中华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29479,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"韩退之庙","author":"林槩","text":"退之皆负□□志，作邑当年来此中。\n谩道阳山是穷处，先生于道未尝穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29480,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鉴湖月夜行舟","author":"林槩","text":"湖光如鉴月如圭，月下湖中两桨飞。\n鹤氅四垂冰骨爽，夜深疑自广寒归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29481,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"剡郊野思","author":"林槩","text":"密树芳秾碧草齐，春华微度绿阴低。\n溪连嵊水兴何尽，路接仙源人自迷。\n落絮有情风上下，好花无语日东西。\n故园桃李经年别，一望归心绕翠蹊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29482,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"越中五咏 其一","author":"林槩","text":"越绝烟光隐翠微，兰亭春色送行衣。\n风清汉相鸣樵径，台古任公落钓矶。\n绣被歌残人竟远，桃花源静客忘归。\n凭君莫上秦山望，千古骊宫对夕晖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29483,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"越中五咏 其四 西村","author":"林槩","text":"绿郊凝望久徘徊，落日川原映古台。\n江上晚风三弄笛，陇头春信一枝梅。\n东西陌外烟光度，紫翠峰前霁色开。\n不是罗敷莫回首，城南五马使君来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29484,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"越中五咏 其三 离席","author":"林槩","text":"何处骊驹杂楚歌，楚人归思托云萝。\n河阳望竟妾心远，金谷别来郎恨多。\n往事一春空物态，閒情千里旧风波。\n归时莫听陇头水，肠断不禁年少何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29485,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"越中五咏 其二 野望宴集","author":"林槩","text":"碧树阴秾曲沼滨，赏心何处乐游频。\n东吴景物兰亭晚，西洛烟光梓泽春。\n香散落梅忘怨笛，绿铺幽草妒芳茵。\n风云流散苦无定，且学阳池倒载身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29486,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"越中五咏 其五 野塘","author":"林槩","text":"漠漠横塘一水通，霏霏轻蔼夕阳中。\n吴娘晚唱穿菱叶，楚客春心托蕙丛。\n烟外蒹葭閒倚路，波间舴艋半凌风。\n江南景好游人去，二月大堤花艳红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29487,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题曲水阁","author":"林槩","text":"胜绝千岩地，清涵一水滨。\n石泉寒绕涧，山木翠和春。\n秀入壶中望，幽凝物外身。\n贤侯足真赏，王谢有芳尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29488,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴中寒食","author":"林歆","text":"寒食家家踏晓晴，好风吹我出重城。\n几湾野水迎人白，数点家山刮眼明。\n已有鸰原联乘乐，何须鹢尾并桡行。\n山前父老应相笑，为我频来学送迎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29489,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题合浦守袁梧像","author":"林溥","text":"大造无私只一中，历公五任协民风。\n景星三出南台瑞，边驿千章北海忠。\n日映彤弓开岭北，龙翔沧海启江东。\n只因外补功名损，可恨车音万里空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29490,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天柱峰","author":"林锡翁","text":"共工发怒亦徒然，炼石忙忙女补天。\n既用断鳌并立极，此峰何不立当先。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29491,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天游观","author":"林锡翁","text":"览遍溪山最上头，琳宫贝阙更清幽。\n虽然未得长生诀，也道曾从天上游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29492,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金鸡岩","author":"林锡翁","text":"几载修真洞里人，只凭啁哳报天明。\n丹成不逐刘安去，只在岩头唱五更。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29493,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"猫儿峰","author":"林锡翁","text":"猫儿峰小眼精光，来护仙家石廪粮。\n回顾威风何凛凛，山中安得有拖肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29494,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"隐求斋 其一","author":"林汝砺","text":"蜗名蝇利处樊笼，世事其如转眼空。\n惟有高人林下隐，只求明月与清风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29495,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"接笋岩","author":"林锡翁","text":"儿童日报竹平安，新笋如何折一痕。\n接住喜凭仙掌力，春风胡不长琅玕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29496,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鲈乡亭","author":"林肇","text":"脍鲈珍味是吴乡，丞相曾过赋短章。\n新作水斋堪寓目，旧停桂棹有馀光。\n满前野景烟波阔，自后秋风意气长。\n莫待东曹归忆此，分悭居在碧州旁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29497,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送徐殿院回乡","author":"林霆龙","text":"三十年来人委靡，如今劲节似秋横。\n三条鲠亮为时重，一叶翩翾去国轻。\n莘老不还司谏职，廖公应显出台名。\n遐冲尚赖精神折，未许林泉得隐声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29498,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"林鼐","text":"四围紫翠峰峦合，一片丹青楼阁开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29499,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大江词/念奴娇 寿仙尉十一月初一","author":"林横舟","text":"一蓂呈秀，近迎长佳节，拟书云物。\n隐隐虹桥天际下，光照梅仙丹壁。\n鹏路横飞，蟾宫直上，早脱麻衣雪。\n一时篇翰，并游俱是魁杰。\n长记怀燕良辰，华堂称庆，皓齿清歌发。\n自暖杯中须缓举，莫放金炉香灭。\n事业伊周，功名韩白，未到星星发。\n九天有诏，蓝田□□风月。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29500,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冷泉","author":"林稹","text":"一泓清可沁诗脾，冷暖年来只自知。\n流向西湖载歌舞，回头不似在山时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29501,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卜筑","author":"林羲","text":"卜筑向东郊，低檐浅覆巢。\n自知心计拙，不与市情交。\n夜烛调诗律，晨香玩易爻。\n有时松影散，坐看鹤归巢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29502,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗一首","author":"林邵","text":"西来汉水接江流，大别山前旧沔州。\n看到夕阳无尽兴，一行飞鹭下汀洲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29503,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题式之诗卷后","author":"林璧","text":"少年曾读石屏诗，老去江湖幸见之。\n百倍寻常真足惜，十存八九实堪悲。\n蛙鸣蝉噪人争羡，天巧神功彼自知。\n我欲流传天下去，为求完本补亡谁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29504,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"资圣寺","author":"林夔孙","text":"华峰跨苍穹，下有云一壑。\n翚飞二百秋，蜂巢几千落。\n灵泉际空留，宿雾临除薄。\n山呈万古姿，竹陨六月箨。\n当年有贤令，神交契冥漠。\n怀哉精魄归，永矣香火托。\n至今书壁间，读者为嗟愕。\n好事继前志，刳岩成此阁。\n仰看斗插椽，俯听泉入铎。\n晤言千载心，英气凛欲作。\n西崖望蒙顶，跻攀计已昨。\n忽闻良友同，共写襟期乐。\n遐登破嵘屼，幽讨待绰约。\n磅礴富蒸郁，阴衣茫纷错。\n再拜五华君，许莅他日约。\n霜威净馀氛，晴宇洞寥廓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29505,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题广州光孝寺","author":"林衢","text":"开池曾记虞翻苑，列树今存建德门。\n无客不观丞相砚，有人曾悟祖师幡。\n旧煎诃子泉犹冽，新种菩提叶又繁。\n无奈益州经卷好，千丝丝缕未消痕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29506,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大涤洞天留题","author":"果老","text":"烟霞溟濛峰九转，淀泼屏风倚天半。\n石龙背冷泉声哀，万叠灵鼍飞素练。\n江山登临夙所愿，何当骑麟醉游遍。\n仙人一去不可见，洞天春晚花流远。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29507,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"欧良","text":"红黄冬树叶，紫翠夕阳山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29508,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"欧良","text":"璧固君所寄，镜亦妾所惜。\n乍可返君璧，妾镜不可得。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29509,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"通天岩","author":"欧演","text":"每逢胜境便留神，一路桃花别汉秦。\n绕刹苔封高士迹，临溪客问野人津。\n纡回松竹看非俗，罗列山川识有真。\n踏遍岭头天尺五，飘飘已觉迥风尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29510,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和朱元晦九曲棹歌 其三","author":"欧阳光祖","text":"玉女峰临二曲流，刳心学道几春秋。\n东风不信心如铁，却放石楠花满头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29511,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和朱元晦九曲棹歌 其四","author":"欧阳光祖","text":"仙人驾船朝上真，三曲溪流日浅清。\n读书岩前闻鹤唳，恐是旧时弦诵声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29512,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和朱元晦九曲棹歌 其十","author":"欧阳光祖","text":"游遍丹山与翠崖，新村渡口日西颓。\n神仙有无不可问，欸乃数声归去来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29513,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和朱元晦九曲棹歌 其一","author":"欧阳光祖","text":"听取渔歌说武夷，武夷九曲水涟漪。\n放舟理棹从头去，三十六峰天下奇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29514,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和朱元晦九曲棹歌 其五","author":"欧阳光祖","text":"日日金鸡啁哳鸣，仙机岩前冬复春。\n系舟四曲看题石，诗与人存今几人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29515,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和朱元晦九曲棹歌 其二","author":"欧阳光祖","text":"一曲回看天鉴池，一边草木与云齐。\n金龙玉简无寻处，花自春风鸟自啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29516,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和朱元晦九曲棹歌 其七","author":"欧阳光祖","text":"仙掌峰边仙浴堂，泉声戛戛漱琳琅。\n流从六曲滩头去，犹带落花风里香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29517,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和朱元晦九曲棹歌 其八","author":"欧阳光祖","text":"七曲溪边古寺基，石塘春水绿漪漪。\n澄波不见招提影，只有山光似旧时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29518,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和朱元晦九曲棹歌 其六","author":"欧阳光祖","text":"五曲溪回屋数椽，上依翠壁下流泉。\n幽居不用立名字，大隐一峰高插天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29519,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和朱元晦九曲棹歌 其九","author":"欧阳光祖","text":"神仙蜕骨鼓楼山，一去丹霄更不还。\n停舟八曲访遗迹，风雨萧萧生暮寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29520,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠篆书吴全仲古风","author":"欧阳光祖","text":"黄帝史仓初作书，依类象形书亦疏。\n兽蹄鸟迹颇奇怪，乾端坤倪微发舒。\n周籀大篆十五篇，体制渐与苍史殊。\n秦兼七国有天下，混一土宇同书车。\n赵高采历竞新作，胡母博学誇宏模。\n是时小篆方挺出，苍籀字画勤芟除。\n云阳系囚变隶体，世喜简便争奔趋。\n人文日巧伪日胜，古意自此皆荒芜。\n峄山野火惟焦苏，苦县光和碑亦无。\n宣王石鼓后来出，真赝莫订徒嗟吁。\n阳冰凛凛及前辈，字骨瘦硬中敷腴。\n潮乎下笔亦清切，杜陵谓与李蔡俱。\n寂寥恍已隔千载，游心艺苑惟长驱。\n我朝巨笔惟章徐，武夷近数延陵吴。\n吴君心近觑天巧，瘦不露骨肥不粗。\n小字银钩铁画如，大字龙蛇相郁纡。\n上穷羲黄下秦汉，掎摭彝鼎并盘盂。\n知音惜无浣花老，侯门欲曳邹阳裾。\n劝君行矣勿留滞，识真四海多通儒。\n莫学妇人写阴符，莫作奇字索酒沽。\n摩崖他日颂功德，大字深刻真良图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29521,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满江红 寿吴漕正月十五","author":"欧阳光祖","text":"恰则元宵，灿万灯、星球如昼。\n春乍暖、化工未放，十分花柳。\n和气并随灯夕至，一时钟作人间秀。\n问烟霄、直上舌含香，文摛绣。\n命世杰，调元手。\n荆楚地，淹留久。\n看日边追诏，印垂金斗。\n翠竹苍松身逾健，蛾儿雪竹人如旧。\n愿湘江、卷入玉壶中，为公寿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29522,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瑞鹤仙 寿虞守三月初十","author":"欧阳光祖","text":"得毛韩经学。\n振祖风，挺挺凌烟勋业。\n文章世为甲。\n果妙龄秀发，荐膺衡鹗。\n名登雁塔。\n访梅仙，种河阳桃李，从兹两绾铜符，多少吏民欢洽。\n庆惬。\n归来整顿，松竹笑傲，武夷溪壑。\n韶光恰匝。\n清明过了旬浃。\n喜当初度日。\n称觞春酒，一饮红生双颊。\n愿儿孙，世袭簪缨，代常不乏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29523,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"欧阳光祖","text":"白发骎骎吾老矣，名场从此欲投簪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29524,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]